  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Autenticação no user-microservice.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "if (body.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token salvo na variavel {{token}}');",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "if (body.user && body.user.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.user.id);",
                  "    console.log('userId salvo: ' + body.user.id);",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Retornou token JWT', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('token');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{userUrl}}/auth/users/login",
              "host": [
                "{{userUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "users",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Rota pública. Autentica por e-mail e senha, devolve o JWT (HMAC256) e, em paralelo, envia os dados do usuário via RestTemplate para `POST {{carUrl}}/cache/user`, que grava no Redis com TTL de 120 minutos.\n\nSe o car-microservice estiver fora do ar, o login continua funcionando — a chamada é envolvida em try/catch."
          },
          "response": []
        },
